gl4es preproc: a #define under an #if it cannot evaluate is not substituted

preproc() records "#define NAME <integer>" and replaces NAME by the number in
every line after it, but "#if defined(...)" and other #if expressions it cannot
evaluate are only written through to the GLES compiler. A define in such a
block is recorded all the same, so of

    #if defined( ENABLE_BLUR )
        #define BLUR_SAMPLER_COUNT 1
    #else
        #define BLUR_SAMPLER_COUNT 0
    #endif
    #define SAMPLERCOUNT (2 + BLUR_SAMPLER_COUNT + BLOOM_SAMPLER_COUNT)

the last alternative, 0, is substituted after it, whatever the #if says; a
#define that falls back to being written through (its value is not a plain
integer) gets the substitution from its first token on: the GLES compiler
reads "#define SAMPLERCOUNT (2 + 0 + 0)", and a shader that defines
ENABLE_BLUR indexes SAMPLER[2] of a 2-element array ("S0020: Array subscript
too big" on libmali; glslang: "array index out of range"). Don't Starve's
postprocess*.ksh, 8 of its 104 shaders.

Now a define met under such an #if is not recorded, and one recorded before is
dropped: the GLES compiler's preprocessor expands it. On Don't Starve's 104
shaders only those 8 change, and all of them compile.

diff --git a/src/gl/preproc.c b/src/gl/preproc.c
index 5b8e8b0..fc406e9 100644
--- a/src/gl/preproc.c
+++ b/src/gl/preproc.c
@@ -686,8 +686,19 @@ char* preproc(const char* code, int keepcomments, int gl_es, extensions_t* exts,
                     if(tok.type==TK_SPACE) {
                         // nothing...
                     } else if(tok.type==TK_NEWLINE) {
-                        k = kh_put(define, defines, defname, &ret);
-                        kh_value(defines, k) = defval;
+                        if(nowrite_ifs==-1) {
+                            // Under an #if this preprocessor cannot evaluate (defined(), an
+                            // expression) the define may be one of several alternatives,
+                            // e.g. "#if defined(A) / #define N 1 / #else / #define N 0":
+                            // substituting the last one seen everywhere after would be wrong.
+                            // Leave the name to the GLES compiler's own preprocessor.
+                            k = kh_get(define, defines, defname);
+                            if(k!=kh_end(defines))
+                                kh_del(define, defines, k);
+                        } else {
+                            k = kh_put(define, defines, defname, &ret);
+                            kh_value(defines, k) = defval;
+                        }
                         {
                             int l = p - oldp;
                             memcpy(tok.str, oldp, l);
